{"content":[{"c":["ELIOENAI"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Postexilic descendant of Solomon and the father of Hodaviah and Eliashib (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.3.23-24","r":"1Chr.3.23-24","rawR":"1Chr.3.23-24","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.3.23-24","value":"1Chr.3.23-24"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 3:23-24"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Simeonite chieftain (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.4.36","r":"1Chr.4.36","rawR":"1Chr.4.36","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.4.36","value":"1Chr.4.36"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 4:36"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Head of a Benjamite family (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.7.8","r":"1Chr.7.8","rawR":"1Chr.7.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.7.8","value":"1Chr.7.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 7:8"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. KJV spelling of the Levite Eliehoenai in ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.26.3","r":"1Chr.26.3","rawR":"1Chr.26.3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.26.3","value":"1Chr.26.3"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chronicles 26:3"},". ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Eliehoenai_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Eliehoenai_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Eliehoenai_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Eliehoenai #1"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["5. Man of the priestly family of Pashhur who divorced his foreign wife in Ezra’s day (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.10.22","r":"Ezra.10.22","rawR":"Ezra.10.22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.10.22","value":"Ezra.10.22"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 10:22"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["6. Zattu’s son, who was encouraged by Ezra to divorce his foreign wife during the postexilic era (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.10.27","r":"Ezra.10.27","rawR":"Ezra.10.27","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.10.27","value":"Ezra.10.27"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 10:27"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["7. Postexilic priest who assisted in the dedication of the rebuilt Jerusalem wall (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.12.41","r":"Neh.12.41","rawR":"Neh.12.41","sourceRefs